    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L841-1038) returns 16 measurements, each with a reference value, unit and uncertainty: flux-conservation error, WT QC amplification, log-amplitude r over six regimes (0.919), decapitation retention (0.925), ablation peak shift, WT z_MZ (240 um), six-regime z_MZ r (-0.331, with the 5-regime r > 0.9 excluding NPA reported alongside), three growing-lattice metrics against Beemster & Baskin / Dello Ioio anchors, three gravitropism metrics against Friml / Band anchors, and three specimen metrics. Four points below v2 because the comparisons are now honest: the six-regime z_MZ correlation is negative, the tipping point is 2.8x slower than Band (2012), the growth rate is ~2x below the literature anchor, and the regime benchmarks remain synthetic." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
