    dct:description "`run_self_test()` (L1274-1364) executes 14 deterministic checks in ~3 s: SHA-256 integrity of 5 files, Law 1 on the real operator, emergent capacitor hierarchy, decapitation autonomy, ablation shift, PLT zonality ordering (NPA excluded and disclosed), growing-lattice divisions and bounds, division-rule invariants, lateral ratio monotone in g and symmetric at g = 0, bending reaching the tipping point and gradient dissipation, pin3 slowing, sweep monotonicity, specimen segmentation and 16-metric determinism. Default run regenerates the PNG and 25-frame GIF in ~6 s; `lean` on the loop file exits 0." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
